  "dom_id": "question-134276",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14250390/assets/15d2ded66d86366f481f5e88e3b45fbfc7e4d227b9f49aee35797554412fbb87.png)\n\nAn antique broker has records about the value of an artwork $y$ (in thousands of dollars) at certain times $t$ (in decades) since the artwork was produced. The scatter plot for the data and the corresponding linear regression line are shown above.\n\nAccording to the regression model, what is the residual for the highlighted datapoint?",
